# =====================================================================
# C4 TRANSFER PROBE — PRE-REGISTRATION. ADDED 2026-08-16 AFTER
# RATIFICATION AND AFTER READOUT. ZERO TRAINING LANES.
# **LETTERS ARE WRITTEN HERE, BEFORE ANY NUMBER IS COMPUTED.** This is a
# POST-HOC probe on an adjudicated rung, and that is disclosed: it can
# NARROW or WIDEN D25's licensed sentence, and it cannot un-credit D25's
# win rate, which is a measured fact with its own letter.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# C0. THE QUESTION
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# C4, this rung's own disclosed confound (see :1489-1493): "the head is
# discarded at eval and the evaluated opponent (SH) is not the modelled
# one. **Transfer is untested.**" D25 trains in MIRROR self-play, so the
# "opponent" its auxiliary head learns to predict is a frozen snapshot of
# the agent ITSELF (confound C3(b)). **Did the trunk learn to model AN
# opponent, or only ITSELF?**
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# C1. THE STATISTIC — §5's MACHINERY, POINTED AT A DIFFERENT OPPONENT
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Delta_ref-ctx^SH = NLL(scorer-shaped L6 probe, ctx ABLATED)
#                  - NLL(same probe WITH that lane's ctx),
# both fit and evaluated on ONE FROZEN REFERENCE TAPE, mean over 8
# battle-level 70/30 splits (seeds 0-7), lambda FROZEN at 0.01, no
# per-lane selection, LBFGS max_iter >= 2000 with ||g||_2 < 1e-3
# asserted on every fit. Identical to §5 in every respect EXCEPT the
# opponent whose action is the label.
# **THE TAPE: the SAME reference checkpoint §5 used — s36@12M, which is
# in NEITHER ARM — playing `SimpleHeuristicsPlayer` instead of playing
# itself.** 300 battles. Arm-symmetric by construction: one tape supplies
# the observations, labels and splits for every lane, so only the ctx
# encoder varies and the ablated arm is common-mode.
# ARMS: treatment s52-56 vs control s26/27/28/50/51 — the same ten lanes
# §5 graded, so the ONLY change from the banked letter is the opponent.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# C2. THE TEST AND ITS LEVEL
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Exact one-sided permutation on the difference of means, **treatment
# HIGHER**, enumerated over all splits. n_T = 5 vs n_C = 5: 252 splits,
# LEVEL 12/252 = 0.047619, min attainable p 1/252 = 0.003968. Ties count
# as extreme (conservative). Anti-conservatism under heteroscedasticity
# (0.052-0.054) inherited from §5 and disclosed.
# **UPPER SIDE ONLY.** If the point estimate runs the other way, the
# direction = -1 test is a SEPARATE one-sided test reported under its own
# name, never "the same test with the sign flipped".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# C3. THE READS, PRE-STATED
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# **FIRES (p <= 12/252, treatment HIGHER):** the trunk's opponent-action
#   structure decodes an opponent it NEVER TRAINED AGAINST better than
#   the control lanes' trunks do. C4 is DISCHARGED. Licensed addition,
#   and it is the strongest sentence this probe can buy: "the
#   representation transfers to an opponent outside the training
#   distribution." C3(b) (self-model) is NOT discharged by this — mirror
#   self-play remains the training regime — but the "it only models
#   itself" reading is refuted.
# **DOES NOT FIRE:** transfer is **NOT DEMONSTRATED**. It is NOT
#   established absent. C4 stays a live disclosure on the claim, and the
#   licensed sentence gains: "whether the representation transfers to a
#   different opponent was tested and not demonstrated." **The
#   distinction is load-bearing and the readout must not blur it.**
# **NEGATIVE (direction = -1 fires):** control lanes decode SH BETTER
#   than treatment lanes. That would say the auxiliary loss made the
#   trunk WORSE at modelling an out-of-distribution opponent — a
#   specificity finding that narrows the claim toward self-consistency.
#   Recorded with its own one-sided p.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# C4-POWER. HONESTY, PRE-STATED — THIS PROBE IS WEAK AND A NULL IS CHEAP
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# §5's own operating characteristics on the mirror tape give MDE(80%)
# 0.0105 (best case) to 0.0301 (worst admissible corner). **This probe
# is expected to be WEAKER still, for a reason that is structural rather
# than statistical: SH is a scripted, near-deterministic policy, so the
# TOTAL decodable structure on an SH tape is smaller in absolute nats
# than on a self-play tape — there is simply less for any probe to
# find.** A1 (the mask-renormalised marginal) and the oracle window are
# therefore expected to be smaller, and the same absolute Delta is a
# larger fraction of a smaller pool.
# **CONSEQUENCE, WRITTEN BEFORE THE NUMBERS: a null here is the MODAL
# OUTCOME and licenses almost nothing. This probe is run because a FIRE
# would be strong evidence and costs an hour, not because its null is
# informative.** Report A1, the ablated NLL, and the realised total
# decodable structure alongside the atoms, so a null can be attributed
# to "nothing to find" versus "found nothing".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# C5-BOUND. WHAT THIS CANNOT DO, IN ANY BRANCH
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# - It cannot un-credit D25's 0.6185, which is a win rate with its own
#   letter and its own placebo control.
# - It cannot license "belief state" — §5's claim bound holds unchanged:
#   the probe reads opponent entity features the policy's scorer never
#   receives, so it upper-bounds policy-usable belief.
# - It cannot discharge C3(b). Training is still mirror self-play.
# - A FIRE does not make the head shipped: it is train-time only and
#   nothing at evaluation consults an opponent model.
# =====================================================================
